!docs/blueprint/16-CORE-BASELINE-AND-COMPATIBILITY-CONTRACT.md
!docs/blueprint/17-IGX1-DESIGN.md
!docs/blueprint/18-IGPV1-DESIGN.md
!docs/blueprint/19-IGDM1-DESIGN.md
!docs/blueprint/21-IGP1-DESIGN.md
